---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CATEGORIES } from '../lib/entries.js';
---
<Base title="Contribute" description="How to add a Grok Bot to Howff." path="/contribute">
  <main id="main" class="page">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="kicker">Contribute</p>
      <h1>Add a bot in one pull request.</h1>
      <p>
        Each bot is a JSON file in <code>data/entries/</code>, plus a markdown file with its
        instructions if you can publish them. The <a href="/submit">submit form</a> drafts both
        for you. Full spec:
        <a href="https://github.com/howffdotdev/howff/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>House rules</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Real bots with live links. One bot per pull request.</li>
        <li>Filename matches the slug, lowercase with hyphens.</li>
        <li>One category: <code>{CATEGORIES.join(' · ')}</code>.</li>
        <li>Only publish instructions you wrote or that are licensed for it, and name the licence.</li>
        <li>British English. Run <code>npm run validate</code> before you push.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
